Seed the five samples that draw from the default `kotlin.random.Random` on composition, so their
renders are reproducible across runs instead of producing a fresh diff on every CI build:

 - ContextualFlowColumnSample (`ContextualFlowColumn_ItemPosition`): `Random` -> `Random(it)`
 - ContextualFlowRowSample (`ContextualFlowRow_ItemPosition`): `Random` -> `Random(it)`
 - FlowColumnSample (`SimpleFlowColumn_EqualWidth`): thread `Random(it)` into `generateRandomString`
 - FlowRowSample (`SimpleFlowRow_EqualHeight`): thread `Random(it)` into `generateRandomString`
 - BorderSamples (`BorderSampleWithDynamicData`): `remember { Random(0) }` for the initial state and
   the button click handlers

